128	          flag('a "schedule" task states a condition that reads the item itself',
129	            `write "trigger": "${TRIGGER_REQUEST}" — a condition about one item can only be judged once an item exists, and the scheduler's ask at a tick has none, so this task would fail every tick instead of declining`);
