132	          // request task, so every occurrence of it is an item somebody created,
133	          // every such item carries `Woken:`, and a wake stands in for the cadence.
134	          // The term cannot decline a single run, and reads as though it could.
135	          flag('a "request" task states a cadence term',
136	            'drop the term — nothing asks this task, so every item of it is one somebody created and carries `Woken:`, which satisfies a cadence; the term can never decline a run, it only reads as though it limits the lever');
